*.suo

# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The 69MB standalone exe publishes to ../EVE-MultiPreview-Release/,
# outside the repo, so it is not merely ignored - it is out of the
# working tree and cannot be committed. /publish stays listed to catch
# any older command that still passes -o publish.
/obj
/bin
/publish
/tests/**/bin/
/tests/**/obj/

# ── Local tooling caches ────────────────────────────────────────
graphify-out/
.codegraph/
.company/

# ── Local working files, not release artifacts ──────────────────
CLAUDE.md
GitHub-Release-Notes.md
QA_REPORT.md

